  "description": "Love is divine.\n\nMiso Lee lives an uneventful life. Then one day, a man drops down from the heavens before her and claims to be a god. He also insists that Miso has a ring… one he had given to his lover centuries ago. Is he telling the truth? And if he is, does that mean Miso is the reincarnation of his old lover?\n\n(Source: Manta)\n\n*Note: Although originally a Korean work, the first publication in an eligible country of origin was the Chinese translation.*",
